Dart and Flutter packages
-------------------------

The app depends on open-source Dart/Flutter packages published on pub.dev.
Each package keeps its own license in the source archive; the exact resolved
versions are pinned in pubspec.lock. Run `flutter pub deps --style=compact`
or open the package's `LICENSE` under the pub cache to review them.

Runtime services
----------------

System text-to-speech engines, the system share sheet, and the operator's
no-wave backend are used at runtime and are not distributed with this
repository.
